  "meta": {
    "title": "Analytics in GridCraft",
    "about": "Three engines: the text engine counts the letters of a pangram, the array engine takes a histogram of simplex noise, and GridCraft writes both into a workbook, charts each, and exports it as a PDF. Table to Rows (a building block every engine has) runs on the engine its table comes from: each is pinned. Open it with plumcraft-editor --engine text,array,gridcraft."
